a6a3bc32badaf5f07de8fc0386651c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1fea645d/uploads/origins/2389c41a-36f1-4f84-8737-ef97e88a1b29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fa6a3bc32badaf5f07de8fc0386651c, https://si.imgix.net/1fea645d/uploads/origins/2389c41a-36f1-4f84-8737-ef97e88a1b29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ab765c0e5e70d78fa15c3612f8740e4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1fea645d/uploads/origins/2389c41a-36f1-4f84-8737-ef97e88a1b29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b272e19b8831cd029f65ae31b3c7917e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello. Your art is incredible! I would like to commission your art for my vtuber and my friend. \n\nIn this story, there is a mafia war. To prevent more lives from being taken away, my friend and I decided to fight and save people. In the art, my friend and I should be fighting together as a team. \n\nHere is a pose reference: https://i.redd.it/gnqbj3s39va51.jpg\nThe pose is simply a reference, it shows the dynamic I would like. \n\nCharacters: \nMy vtuber Shin Vero is a charming, confident half-devil. He fights with a pistol and has demonic powers. It would be great if you can include the demonic eyes (black and red). https://imgur.com/a/3012EDI\n\nMy friend Ismiyu is a fox spirit, she has Qi energy that allows her to heal others. It would be great if you can include the umbrella in her design: https://imgur.com/a/3012EDI \n\nI will leave the background for you to decide. Thank you for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@VvpXo/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/05370f18/uploads/origins/270fb17d-085a-4c58-9c2c-177623981f22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=60b1edefde402ef2ae6d37805219af55", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/05370f18/uploads/origins/270fb17d-085a-4c58-9c2c-177623981f22?bg=%23fff&auto